     3	Source of truth for architectural decisions in `@hachej/boring-agent`. Any PR that changes a locked decision must update this document and include rationale in the PR description.
     4	
     5	See also: [REVIEW_DECISIONS.md](kanzen/REVIEW_DECISIONS.md) for adopted/deferred findings from external reviews.
     6	See also: [WORKSPACE_CONTRACT.md](./WORKSPACE_CONTRACT.md) for the `@hachej/boring-agent` ↔ `@hachej/boring-workspace` integration contract.
