   172	## 11. Workspace scope
   173	
   174	| Field | |
   175	|---|---|
   176	| **What** | Single workspace per instance. `workspaceId` from config. No runtime CRUD; that belongs to `@boring/cloud`. |
   177	| **Why** | The agent operates on one project at a time. Multi-workspace is a platform concern. |
   178	| **Rationale** | Single-workspace simplifies the entire stack: one root, one sandbox, one session store scope. |
   179	| **Re-evaluate when** | `@boring/cloud` needs the agent to manage workspaces. |
