   271	## 16. Import convention
   272	
   273	| Field | |
   274	|---|---|
   275	| **What** | `@boring/agent` (top-level, browser-safe) + `@boring/agent/server` (Node-only) + `@boring/agent/shared` (type-only). |
   276	| **Why** | Separate entry points prevent Node APIs from leaking into browser bundles. |
   277	| **Rationale** | Three entry points match three execution contexts. `shared` is type-only to avoid any runtime dependency. |
   278	| **Re-evaluate when** | A fourth entry point is needed (e.g., `@boring/agent/worker`). |
