   324	| **Rationale** | Two real consumers justify the small definition boundary immediately: local development and agent-host deployment. A separate deployment object keeps reusable behavior portable. One SQLite transaction removes the event/pending-state crash window. Dedicated tenancy gives a strong isolation baseline without inventing a shared tenant authority. Later capabilities retain their plans but earn implementation through a concrete consumer and separate exit. |
