    28	 * consumes. The resolver contract is unchanged.
    29	 *
    30	 * Fail-closed rules: an unready backend, an unknown record, a wrong/absent
    31	 * KEK, or any tampered ciphertext/nonce/tag/AAD component throws a stable
    32	 * `CredentialResolutionError`. Nothing here ever returns "absent" in place of
    33	 * an authentication failure, and nothing ever falls back to another backend or
    34	 * to plaintext. Plaintext DEKs and field values are overwritten in `finally` on
    35	 * a best-effort basis (Node/V8 cannot guarantee erasure).
