    97	 * `@hachej/boring-core`, structurally satisfied here) into the per-agent
    98	 * MCP grant seam. This is the canonical persistence home per gh-1087: no new
    99	 * store, no new table — grants live alongside every other structured
   100	 * per-workspace resource.
