     3	/**
     4	 * Per-agent MCP grant: the only thing that lets an Agent's declared
     5	 * `mcpServerRefs` resolve into anything. Resolution is default-deny — a
     6	 * connectorId with no matching grant for the exact `(workspaceId,
     7	 * agentTypeId)` pair yields nothing, ever, regardless of what other Agents
     8	 * in the same workspace are granted.
